00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:11.490
and it became about other
people that I stopped

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:12.750
and I was like, this is too much.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:14.430
My life is already giving to everybody.

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:15.900
This should be for me.

00:10:15.900 --> 00:10:17.519
