00:10:18.352 --> 00:10:19.920
- It does, it becomes for other people.

00:10:19.920 --> 00:10:21.150
And it's like, wait, wait, wait.

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:21.983
This should be for us.

00:10:21.983 --> 00:10:22.816
But enjoy it though.

00:10:22.816 --> 00:10:23.700
Big weddings are fun.

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:24.690
- No, it's exciting.

00:10:24.690 --> 00:10:26.910
We're just trying to find the right venue,

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:28.800
but we already have the
entertainment booked

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:29.970
and I've said this a thousand times-

00:10:29.970 --> 00:10:31.440
